id: flash-api
section: Flash
item: FlashVars arrive, ExternalInterface works both ways, getURL and fscommand reach the page, allowScriptAccess is honoured, a shared object survives a daemon restart, a movie loads data and a movie from its own origin
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-instr-features.swf&api=1&vars=a=hello%26reset=1
kit: cavekit-flash.md R4
wait text ready features 30
wait text vars "vars a=hello" 20
wait text so "so n=1" 20
wait text echoback "echoback back hi" 30
expect text echo "echo hi"
wait text geturl "geturl ok" 20
wait text fscommand "fscommand jcmd jarg" 20
wait text data "data true x=42" 20
wait text kid "kid w=" 30
daemon-restart http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?swf=jihad-instr-features.swf
wait text so "so n=2" 40
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&allow=never
wait rect m 20
expect text count 0
dwell 5000
expect text count 0
